{"title":"Beethoven's Fifth with World Reknown Pianist Angela Hewitt + Pre-concert (TSO)","startsAt":"2026-10-09T17:45:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-09T23:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"On **Friday October 9th,** **join me to see** **internationally acclaimed Canadian Pianist and 2026/27 Spotlight Artist Angela Hewitt perform Beethoven’s Fourth Piano Concerto prior to the Orchestra's Fifth Symphony**. Jörg Widmann’s *Con brio* opens with a witty, high-spirited homage to Beethoven. Then, Hewitt brings poetic grace to Beethoven’s Fourth Piano Concerto, before the orchestra unleashes the composer’s thunderous Fifth Symphony—with the famous first four notes that changed classical music forever. Enhance your concert experience by arriving early for exquisite performances by the [TSO Chamber Soloists](https://www.tso.ca/about/orchestra/the-tso-chamber-soloists), thoughtfully curated by Jonathan Crow and included with the price of your ticket. My seat is Orchestra Right C34. **Purchase your own tickets for Beethoven's Fifth on Friday October 9th at 7:30pm. I can also extend my subscriber discount to members.**\n\n**PROGRAM**\n**Jörg Widmann**: *Con brio*\n\n**Beethoven**: Piano Concerto No. 4\n**Beethoven**: Symphony No. 5\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $70 - 208 includes taxes and fees.\n\nSubscriber additional tickets: $40 - 135 includes taxes and fees.\n\nRush: A limited number of tickets may go on sale at 1pm online, over the phone, or in-person at Roy Thomson Hall. Limit 2 per person based on availability.\n\nMeetup fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final and non-refundable.\n\n***\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes, [purchase](https://my.tso.ca/3966/3992) your ticket and post your seat number and I will move you to attending.**\n* If you'd like a discounted ticket, please message me after you RSVP with your preferred seating location. I will confirm the subscriber discount price, and once you send an etransfer, your ticket will be purchased and provided in person at event start time.\n* If you plan to buy RUSH, please state that in your RSVP, so I can include you in the pre-mail and we can meet you.\n* RSVPs close 2 days prior, and cancellations after will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n* A reminder will go out the day before with my cell and details when to meet, etc.\n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐-------------‐-----------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for the Pre-Concert at: 5:45pm** **at Roy Thomson Hall at 60 Simcoe St., inside the southern-most double set of glass doors, after scanning your tickets. There are a limited number of seats in the choir loft, so get there on time to get a seat and sit together.**\n\n**Pre-concert start time: 6:15pm**\n\n**Meet me for the Concert at: 7:15pm** **at Roy Thomson Hall at 60 Simcoe St., inside the southern-most double set of glass doors, after scanning your tickets.**\n\n**Concert start time: 7:30pm**\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!","venue":{"name":"Roy Thomson Hall","address":"60 Simcoe St, Toronto","lat":43.646606,"lng":-79.386406,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Experience Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/2/7/8/highres_536257496.jpeg"}